        <p>When something's wrong with your electrical system -- a breaker keeps tripping, an outlet is burning, half your house has no power, or your panel is buzzing -- you don't want to wait three days for an appointment. Osborne Electric responds same-day for urgent electrical issues across the Wasatch Front.</p>
        <p>We hold Utah DOPL contractor license #12644476-5501, with all electrical work qualified by Master Electrician Wes Osborne (#8528070-5502) -- not a dispatch service, not a call center. When you call, you talk to a human who can tell you honestly when we can be there.</p>
