          <li>Breakers that won't reset</li>
          <li>Tripped GFCI that won't reset</li>
          <li>Newly flickering lights throughout the house</li>
          <li>Damaged service drop (wire from pole to house)</li>
          <li>EV charger, hot tub, or appliance circuit failure</li>
          <li>Recent water damage near electrical equipment</li>
          <li>Storm damage to weather head or service mast</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="tel:801-885-4521" class="btn btn-primary">Call 801-885-4521</a>
