        <p>Then call us once the immediate safety threat is secured. We can be on site to assess damage, secure the panel, and get power restored.</p>
        <h3>What to do while waiting for us:</h3>
        <ul class="features-list">
          <li>Turn off the affected circuit at the panel if safe to do so</li>
          <li>Unplug appliances on the affected circuit</li>
          <li>Don't reset a tripped breaker repeatedly</li>
          <li>Stay away from any water near electrical equipment</li>
          <li>Keep the work area clear for our electrician</li>
